      "text": "by Ann Schnake and the Mickies\nA residency and unfolding exhibition of new and continued works",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:24px; line-height:1.2em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.05em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:din-next-w01-light,din-next-w02-light,din-next-w10-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">by Ann Schnake and the Mickies</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:24px; line-height:1.2em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.05em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:din-next-w01-light,din-next-w02-light,din-next-w10-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">A residency and unfolding exhibition of new and continued works</span></span></span></span></span></p>",
